    "Each row is one of the last 7 days, today at the bottom; each column is an hour of the day, 00 to 23 (your local time). Darker squares mean more tokens; hover a square for its total.%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each row is one of the last 7 days, today at the bottom; each column is an hour of the day, 00 to 23 (your local time). Darker squares mean more tokens; hover a square for its total.%@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Her satır son 7 günden birini gösterir; bugün en altta. Her sütun günün bir saatidir, 00’dan 23’e (yerel saatiniz). Koyu kareler daha fazla token anlamına gelir; toplamı görmek için kareye üzerinize gelin.%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一列是最近 7 天中的一天，今天在最下方；每一欄是一天中的一個小時，00 到 23（當地時間）。顏色越深代表 tokens 越多；游標停在格子上可看總數。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
