            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tokens"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens in each of the last 24 hours (your local time), from the CLI's local logs on this Mac (input, output and cache), with the estimated API-equivalent cost. Usage on other machines or the web isn't included.%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tokens in each of the last 24 hours (your local time), from the CLI's local logs on this Mac (input, output and cache), with the estimated API-equivalent cost. Usage on other machines or the web isn't included.%@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son 24 saatin her birindeki token’lar (yerel saatiniz); bu Mac’teki CLI’nin yerel günlüklerinden (girdi, çıktı ve önbellek), tahmini API eşdeğeri maliyetle. Başka makinelerdeki veya web’deki kullanım dahil değildir.%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近 24 小時每小時的 tokens（當地時間），取自這台 Mac 上 CLI 的本機記錄（輸入、輸出與快取），並附估計的等值 API 費用。不含其他電腦或網頁上的用量。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens in each of the last 24 hours (your local time), the newest on the right. Darker squares mean more tokens; hover a square for its total.%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tokens in each of the last 24 hours (your local time), the newest on the right. Darker squares mean more tokens; hover a square for its total.%@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son 24 saatin her birindeki token’lar (yerel saatiniz); en yeni sağda. Koyu kareler daha fazla token anlamına gelir; toplamı görmek için kareye üzerinize gelin.%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近 24 小時每小時的 tokens（當地時間），最新的在右邊。顏色越深代表 tokens 越多；游標停在格子上可看總數。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens per day (your local time) over the %@, from the CLI's local logs on this Mac (input, output and cache), with the estimated API-equivalent cost. Usage on other machines or the web isn't included.%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tokens per day (your local time) over the %@, from the CLI's local logs on this Mac (input, output and cache), with the estimated API-equivalent cost. Usage on other machines or the web isn't included.%@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Günlük token’lar (yerel saatiniz), %@ boyunca; bu Mac’teki CLI’nin yerel günlüklerinden (girdi, çıktı ve önbellek), tahmini API eşdeğeri maliyetle. Başka makinelerdeki veya web’deki kullanım dahil değildir.%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@每天的 tokens（當地時間），取自這台 Mac 上 CLI 的本機記錄（輸入、輸出與快取），並附估計的等值 API 費用。不含其他電腦或網頁上的用量。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
